// BG-ONLY WORKFLOW — Bulgaria / Sofia / Remote Bulgaria only.
// Decision hierarchy (Normalize Verified Review guards):
// 1. BG-only card label guard => REJECT if not clearly Bulgaria, Sofia, or Remote Bulgaria
// 2. Explicit FullJobText location restriction outside Bulgaria => REJECT (FINAL_REJECT_LOCATION)
// 3. BG-only FullJobText broad-remote guard (Remote Europe/EMEA/Worldwide, relocation) => REJECT
// 4. Hard fit disqualifier => REJECT (FINAL_REJECT)
// 5. Eligible and strong fit => APPLY
//
// Hard Fit Guard regression examples (must REJECT, not MONITOR):
// - professional fluency in French + 10+ years selling enterprise software into France and/or Benelux
// - fluent Romanian + strong Romanian renewable-energy network
// - fluent French + deep France/Benelux enterprise sales
